# autotest alpha.8 wave 2 (2026-11-21). Written against the Feature text with sha 657c024af26774d9; honest subset only: everything not checked is under not-covered.
row: F-WEB-32
targets: browser
feature-sha: 657c024af26774d9
doc: web page Git: a clone is listed, opened for status, diff, log and branches; an address with a password is refused
clause: 1 the Git page lists the clone of the person's space with its branch and opens it for status (changed and new files), a diff drawn with + and - in the text, the log newest first and branches
clause: 2 an address with a password in it is refused and the secret is neither sent nor shown
not-covered: paging of the log
not-covered: binary or too large states
not-covered: loading, empty, error and not-allowed states
not-covered: cloning a repository from the page (the https-only check is only seen through the refusal)
suite: run_pages.py --only more
